        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does ITD GrowthLabs run skincare performance marketing in Riyadh?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Full-stack: channel mix (Meta + Google + Shopping + PMax + Snapchat GCC + WhatsApp CTWA), creative production (in-house pod 15-25 units/week), attribution stack + LTV/CAC/subscription-cohort reporting, skin-quiz landing pages, creator + derm-partnership programme, seasonal + concern-cycle + gifting campaigns. Grounded in ITD's 50-piece skincare cluster + case studies (Kama Ayurveda + Plum + Sugar + WOW + Foxtale + Minimalist + Deconstruct + The Derma Co + Just Herbs (India); Sephora private label + The Body Shop + Huda Beauty + emerging local D2C (GCC)). Retainer starts at SAR 4,000-20,000 + ad spend transparent pass-through. See <a href='/industries/digital-marketing-for-skincare-brands.php'>Digital Marketing for Skincare Brands</a>.</div>
